      "form": "declarative_certain",
      "topic": "macroeconomics",
      "intent": "investment_advice",
      "boundary_kind": "",
      "boundary_meaning": "",
      "boundary_basis": "",
      "text": "A fourth consecutive month of cooling core inflation confirms that the disinflation trend is intact, and the sensible step for savers is to move cash out of money-market funds and into intermediate-dated Treasuries."
